IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 ORD-TOTAL          PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 SVC-LEVEL          PIC X.
    05 DEST-ZONE          PIC X(2).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 FREE-SHIP-IND      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 DELIV-FEE          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    05 EXTRA-CHG          PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CHECK-FREE-SHIP
    PERFORM 3100-ZONE-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "FREE-SHIP-IND=" FREE-SHIP-IND
    DISPLAY "DELIV-FEE=" DELIV-FEE
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-CHG=" EXTRA-CHG
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-FREE-SHIP.
    IF ORD-TOTAL >= 75 AND SVC-LEVEL = 'S'
        MOVE 'Y' TO FREE-SHIP-IND
        MOVE 0 TO DELIV-FEE
    END-IF.
3100-ZONE-SURCHG.
    IF DEST-ZONE = 'Z7' OR DEST-ZONE = 'Z8'
        MOVE 15 TO EXTRA-CHG
    END-IF.
